{"version":1,"content":"<p>美東時間周二，知名做空機構渾水（Muddy Waters）對外披露，已經建立英偉達空頭頭寸。渾水在做空報告並未直接拋出財務造假結論，而是圍繞一樁GPU違規轉賣案件，對英偉達、超微電腦兩家企業前高管之間是否存在人際關聯提出疑問，進一步放大市場對於英偉達出口合規鏈條的擔憂。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586916.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:07:19.112454+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:44:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:36.076973+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:00:36.076973+00:00","content_hash":"88084b9ebce6cf5b183fe0abc95e25315a138f4ea39e76f963b57bf822635619","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}